#!/bin/bash
# All row-leg mock cases (fixtures regenerated by gen.py), 8 at a time; one line each: case, expected, got, OK|MISMATCH,
# the leg's reason; then TOTAL. Exit 0 only when every case gives its expected verdict.
M=$(cd "$(dirname "$0")" && pwd); python3 -I $M/gen.py $M/fx || exit 1; rm -rf $M/work
ls $M/fx | xargs -P ${J:-8} -n1 $M/run-case.sh | sort | tee $M/results.txt
ok=$(grep -c ' OK ' $M/results.txt); bad=$(grep -c ' MISMATCH ' $M/results.txt); n=$(ls $M/fx | wc -l | tr -d ' ')
echo "TOTAL $n cases: OK $ok MISMATCH $bad"; [ "$ok" = "$n" ]
